{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44682","headline":"冬日普光寺卧疾值雪简诸旧游 · 慧净","name":"冬日普光寺卧疾值雪简诸旧游","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"卧疴苦留滞，辟户望遥天。\n寒云舒复卷，落雪断还连。\n凝华照书阁，飞素涴琴弦。\n回飘洛神赋，皎映齐纨篇。\n萦阶如鹤舞，拂树似花鲜。\n徒赏丰年瑞，沈忧终自怜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"慧净","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44682.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44682","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}